18,14460,14810,16410,14993,15895,15728,15560,15493,15477,15761,15477,15477,15814,15627,15456,15814,15763,15609,15299,14681,13634,15403,14681,14750,14487,13825,14191,15342,14134,14661,15100,15311,15451,15363,14538,14275,14525,14061,14918,14043,13935,13665,12692,13035,13017,14025,13845,14169,13550,13128,13605,13403,13388,12925,12148,11481,11074,9944,10648,11518,10703,9754,8948,8872,9793,10696,10561,10619,10850,10446,11522,11061,9759,9167,9265,9818,9130,8880,8790],"v":[8741280,7534800,15550680,26220720,24839640,18630480,17227200,14214360,14835120,10730160,14301000,9465600,11077080,25136760,23136720,30206160,23551560,16741680,30565800,12245548,14878000,17554800,16166400,29955500,17751700,22803400,12839000,16577500,14600600,16225200,10270400,11149800,12286300,16968000,12426200,13768200,12040100,9946600,13420600,20372900,13682900,14853900,17349600,17577900,10587500,12997600,14047700,9870500,8081900,11961900,12161600,13496600,9008900,8054100,11127700,6175500,9595900,14787300,7229000,14406900,10546600,6721000,16717800,16193300,7871100,12239100,12241800,6150900,10487900,15799700,14334600,14092200,11394400,9061000,9465500,16633400,5084100,11373700,13878900,6779800,13072700,10299500,17251900,20510200,12448400,8859000,10476300,17313600,19865700,24452200,16099900,9193700,14053900,11746400,12558300,12118600,12811900,7581600,9569500,14713800,9122200,7176100,14651200,24872100,141942200,52686300,33400700,20088400,19677000,13228900,11400300,18960300,10537100,7315900,13217100,6869400,9283100,10860300,8010000,3484300]}},"profile":{"website":"https://www.ppbgroup.com","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","employees":6162,"city":"Kuala Lumpur","summary":"PPB Group Berhad, an investment holding and property investment company, engages in the grains and agribusiness worldwide. It operates through the Grains and Agribusiness, Consumer Products, Film Exhibition and Distribution, Property, and Other Operations segments. The company is involved in the flour milling; manufacture of animal feed; trading of wheat and maize; production of day-old-chicks, eggs, and other related downstream activities; oil palm plantations; exhibition and distribution of movies and content; letting of commercial properties; development of residential and commercial properties; and chemical trading and manufacturing. It also offers packaged flour products under the Anchor, Blue Key, and Muhibah brands; loaf, sandwich loaf with wheat germ, whole wheat loaf, fine whole wheat loaf, ricco chocolato, seeded multigrain with barley, kurma and roasted walnut, favorito cream rolls, duetto cream rolls, chiffon in a cup, diletto moist cake, burrosa pound cake, and divino cream rolls and bun under the Massimo brand. In addition, the company provides kaya spreads under the Toast Mate brand; blended cooking oil under the Neptune brand; double fractionated palm-based vegetable oil and eggs under the Seri Murni brand; pure corn oil, sunflower oil, and canola oil under the Krystal brand; and canned sardines, tuna, baked beans, peas, Italian, carbonara, and shoyu pasta sauce with tuna, as well as nuggets, sausages, beef balls, square burgers, chicken burgers, and chicken fries under the Marina brand. Further, it offers solutions and IT services, including point-of-sale systems and hardware, business intelligence, support and maintenance, customization, and integration. The company was formerly known as Perlis Plantations Berhad and changed its name to PPB Group Berhad in 2000. The company was incorporated in 1968 and is headquartered in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia. PPB Group Berhad is a subsidiary of Kuok Brothers Sdn. Bhd.","zh":"PPB Group Berhad 是一家投资控股和房地产投资公司，成立于1968年，总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡，是Kuok Brothers Sdn. Bhd.的子公司。公司最初名为Perlis Plantations Berhad，于2000年更名为PPB Group Berhad。公司业务涵盖谷物与农业综合企业、消费品、电影放映与发行、房地产及其他运营。","lines":["谷物与农业综合企业：从事面粉研磨、动物饲料制造、小麦和玉米贸易、一日龄雏鸡和鸡蛋生产及相关下游活动，以及油棕种植园。","消费品：生产及销售多种品牌包装食品，包括Anchor、Blue Key、Muhibah品牌的面粉，Massimo品牌的面包和糕点，Toast Mate品牌的咖椰酱，Neptune品牌的调和食用油，Seri Murni品牌的 Palm 基植物油和鸡蛋，Krystal品牌的玉米油、葵花籽油和芥花籽油，以及Marina品牌的罐头沙丁鱼、金枪鱼、烘焙豆、豌豆、意大利面酱、鸡块、香肠、牛肉丸、汉堡和鸡柳等。","电影放映与发行：从事电影和内容的放映与发行。","房地产：出租商业物业，以及开发住宅和商业物业。","其他运营：包括化学贸易和制造，以及提供解决方案和IT服务，如销售点系统、硬件、商业智能、支持与维护、定制和集成。"],"lines_en":["Grains and Agribusiness: Engaged in flour milling, animal feed manufacturing, wheat and maize trading, production of day-old-chicks and eggs, oil palm plantations, and related downstream activities.","Consumer Products: Manufactures and sells packaged food products under brands such as Anchor, Blue Key, Muhibah (flour), Massimo (bread and pastries), Toast Mate (kaya spread), Neptune (blended cooking oil), Seri Murni (palm-based vegetable oil and eggs), Krystal (corn, sunflower, and canola oils), and Marina (canned sardines, tuna, baked beans, peas, pasta sauces, nuggets, sausages, beef balls, burgers, and chicken fries).","Film Exhibition and Distribution: Involved in the exhibition and distribution of movies and content.","Property: Letting of commercial properties and development of residential and commercial properties.","Other Operations: Includes chemical trading and manufacturing, and provision of IT solutions and services such as point-of-sale systems, hardware, business intelligence, support and maintenance, customization, and integration."]}}